         <abstract>
            <p>A History of the <ref type="ins" corresp="INS0341DL">Dabra Libānos of Šawā</ref> monastery written in <date notBefore="1653" notAfter="1654" evidence="internal">1653/1654 CE</date>, see  <bibl><ptr target="bm:Derat2003Domaine"/><citedRange unit="page">38–39</citedRange></bibl>:  <cit><quote>From the reign of <persName ref="PRS10303Yekunno"/>[1270–1285] until the 23rd year of the reign of King <persName ref="PRS4015Fasilada"/> [1632–1667], 383 years; from the death of our father <persName ref="PRS9162TaklaHa"/> [died in 1313] until the 23rd year of the reign of our King <persName ref="PRS4015Fasilada"/>, 354 years.). 
            </quote></cit>(<cit><quote xml:lang="fr">Du règne de Yekuno Amlak [1270-1285] jusqu’à la 23e année du règne du roi Fasilädäs [1632-1667], 383 années, de la mort de notre père Täklä Haymanot [mort en 1313] jusqu’à la 23e année du règne de notre roi Fasilädäs, 354 années</quote></cit> 
                  </p>
